description: Finance platform architecture
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is a finance automation platform with separate frontend and backend applications.

Architecture principles:
- Preserve the existing architecture and module boundaries.
- Follow existing patterns before introducing new abstractions.
- Keep frontend, backend, database, and infrastructure concerns separated.
- Reuse existing shared components/services/utilities where appropriate.
- Do not introduce new libraries or architectural patterns unless necessary.